window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/c355-5c46c2a083072412.json"]={sha256:"5c46c2a083072412a8be1d0c2dd23f6e4f71b8030aa77a6b57c832243adf2d27",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v24-case-d20ee063572f97df","url":"https://science.nasa.gov/mission/mars-exploration-rovers-spirit-and-opportunity/","title":"Mars Exploration Rovers — NASA Science","titleEn":"Mars Exploration Rovers — NASA Science","publisher":"NASA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"c355","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"c355","related":[{"id":"c356","referenceUrls":["https://science.nasa.gov/mission/msl-curiosity/"],"title":"Curiosity 火星科學實驗室","titleEn":"Curiosity Mars Science Laboratory","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：排程須保留 80 Wh 且每個時間格負載不超限；不足時先延後可重做的科學活動。 每項結論須附輸入、單位、版本與未解限制。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Retain 80 Wh and obey power limits in every bin; defer repeatable science when the plan fails. Attach inputs, units, revision and unresolved limitations to each conclusion.","difference":"以混樣質量平衡辨認真實成分與前一個樣品殘留。","differenceEn":"Use mixture mass balance to distinguish composition from carryover of a preceding sample.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。合成日獲能 700 Wh、固定能耗 380 Wh、保留 80 Wh、科學負載 60 W。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：t=(700−380−80)/60。 結果約 4 h。可用科學時間=(日獲能−固定能耗−保留量)/科學平均功率；不能以日平均掩蓋瞬間功率限制。","以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。合成新樣本 20 mg、分析物 5%；殘留 1 mg、分析物 20%。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：C=(20×5+1×20)/(20+1)。 結果約 5.71429 %。量測濃度=(新樣品質量×濃度+殘留質量×濃度)/總質量；假設各成分均勻混合。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Synthetic daily harvest is 700 Wh, fixed demand 380 Wh, reserve 80 Wh and science demand 60 W. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: t=(700−380−80)/60. Result ≈ 4 h. Science time=(daily harvest−fixed energy−reserve)/science power; daily averages do not remove peak-power limits.","All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Synthetic new sample is 20 mg at 5%; residue is 1 mg at 20%. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: C=(20×5+1×20)/(20+1). Result ≈ 5.71429 %. Measured concentration is the mass-weighted mean of new sample and residue, assuming uniform mixing.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"c365","referenceUrls":["https://global.jaxa.jp/projects/sas/hayabusa2/"],"title":"Hayabusa2 小行星採樣","titleEn":"Hayabusa2 asteroid sample return","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：排程須保留 80 Wh 且每個時間格負載不超限；不足時先延後可重做的科學活動。 每項結論須附輸入、單位、版本與未解限制。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Retain 80 Wh and obey power limits in every bin; defer repeatable science when the plan fails. Attach inputs, units, revision and unresolved limitations to each conclusion.","difference":"評估小樣品質量分配對代表性與保留量的影響。","differenceEn":"Evaluate how small-sample allocation affects representativeness and retained material.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。合成日獲能 700 Wh、固定能耗 380 Wh、保留 80 Wh、科學負載 60 W。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：t=(700−380−80)/60。 結果約 4 h。可用科學時間=(日獲能−固定能耗−保留量)/科學平均功率；不能以日平均掩蓋瞬間功率限制。","以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。合成顆粒稀有成分比例 p=0.02，隨機抽取 n=50。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：P=1−0.98^50。 結果約 0.63583 fraction。獨立隨機抽取 n 顆粒時，至少一顆稀有成分的機率=1−(1−p)^n；團聚或偏選時失效。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Synthetic daily harvest is 700 Wh, fixed demand 380 Wh, reserve 80 Wh and science demand 60 W. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: t=(700−380−80)/60. Result ≈ 4 h. Science time=(daily harvest−fixed energy−reserve)/science power; daily averages do not remove peak-power limits.","All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Use synthetic rare-grain fraction p=0.02 and n=50 random grains. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: P=1−0.98^50. Result ≈ 0.63583 fraction. For n independent random grains, probability of at least one rare component is 1−(1−p)^n; clustering or selection bias invalidates it.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v24-case-133c97a336539179","url":"https://science.nasa.gov/mission/msl-curiosity/","title":"Curiosity Mars Science Laboratory — NASA Science","titleEn":"Curiosity Mars Science Laboratory — NASA Science","publisher":"NASA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v24-case-2cb2de30bc21f35d","url":"https://global.jaxa.jp/projects/sas/hayabusa2/","title":"JAXA Hayabusa2","titleEn":"JAXA Hayabusa2","publisher":"JAXA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
